ces + current events on the international trail/ultra scene.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Between Two Pines</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/between-two-pines.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Between Two Pines" /><published>2026-05-04T00:00:00+02:00</published><updated>2026-05-04T00:00:00+02:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/between-two-pines</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/between-two-pines.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A running podcast for people who think running podcasts are stupid. Dom Grossman and Andy Pearson ask their guests hilariously insulting questions in a "between two ferns" style manner.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Føkk Asfalt / Nå Er Det Alvor</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/n-er-det-alvor.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Føkk Asfalt / Nå Er Det Alvor" /><published>2026-05-04T00:00:00+02:00</published><updated>2026-05-04T00:00:00+02:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/n-er-det-alvor</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/n-er-det-alvor.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><category term="subultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Norwegian mountain ultra trail podcast. 500+ episodes, est. 2018.]]></summary></entry></feed>